CatalogStatus.description:
Free-library reachability. `connected`/`error` come from the source;
`disconnected` means the catalog is disabled (no `catalog_url`). `last_sync` is set
only by the real HttpCatalogSource; the stub leaves it None (nothing synced yet).

TerrainModelConfigView.description:
The terrain-attribution model's effective status. Defaults to the judge config;
`uses_judge_default` is False once any terrain-specific override is set. Write-only key —
`key_hint` is a masked tail, never the key.
